{"overview":"تیمی از وکلای زن طلاق‌گیر از یک شرکت مردسالار جدا می‌شوند و دفتر قدرتمند خود را راه‌اندازی می‌کنند. آن‌ها سرسخت، نابغه و عاطفی پیچیده‌اند و درگیر شکستن روابط پرسر و صدا، رازهای رسوا و تغییر وفاداری‌ها می‌شوند—هم در دادگاه و هم در رده‌های خودشان. در جهانی که پول حرف می‌زند و عشق میدان جنگ است، این زنان نه تنها بازی را می‌سازند، بلکه آن را تغییر می‌دهند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A team of female divorce attorneys leave a male-dominated firm to open their own powerhouse practice. Fierce, brilliant, and emotionally complicated, they navigate high-stakes breakups, scandalous secrets, and shifting allegiances—both in the courtroom and within their own ranks. In a world where money talks and love is a battleground, these women don't just play the game—they change it.","tagline_en":"Miss understood.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":9,"y":2025,"poster":"/akJ3gusmlRGvKoFzLgJxsIBL4W4.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":4,"y":2026,"poster":"/igHpitLtbzBG7EyNZhF9vPYm6PK.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":["Jon Robin Baitz","Joe Baken","رایان مورفی"],"crew_en":["Jon Robin Baitz","Joe Baken","Ryan Murphy"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کیم کارداشیان","role":"Allura Grant","photo":"/3TLSq0aHXyxtqaXe9p7yB5Daqsa.jpg","en":"Kim Kardashian"},{"name":"نائومی واتس","role":"Liberty Ronson","photo":"/7ysvff7ZhW388SIh2YjQ0XIryOn.jpg","en":"Naomi Watts"},{"name":"نیسی نش","role":"Emerald Greene","photo":"/1QblRt1zawcjTHrdXyzAwtdXKYl.jpg","en":"Niecy Nash-Betts"},{"name":"تیانا تایلور","role":"Milan","photo":"/5b2dAuTsBejBsdm9SkWX4F7jG9w.jpg","en":"Teyana Taylor"},{"name":"متئو نوسکا","role":"Chase Munroe","photo":"/1kALpbgg7wmeeVBZ2THHTQCnU4l.jpg","en":"Matthew Noszka"},{"name":"سارا پلسون","role":"Carrington Lane","photo":"/tJnhBV516yrekR3hTDUw15UMbxS.jpg","en":"Sarah Paulson"},{"name":"گلن کلوز","role":"Dina Standish","photo":"/4VHZ1GfLwN7MUgApy0LCBzdDF9L.jpg","en":"Glenn Close"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.